        <item>
            <title>0.6.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:33:37 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>50</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Assembly 0.6.4</h2>
<p>Picture tracks from an EDL:</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Scene tracks for series.</b> On slates that start with the episode,
    like <code>201-101C_02A</code>, the scene is now read after the episode
    — scene 101, setup C — instead of the episode number becoming every
    shot's scene. Slates from other episodes cut into the show no longer
    stop this from working, and setups, unit letters and inserted scenes
    are read the same way as on other slates.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
